# No environment variables or GitHub Secrets are required by the current app.
# The RSVP and guestbook use localStorage; Supabase is not connected.
# Never place private API keys, database passwords, or service-role keys here.
# VITE_* values are publicly visible in the compiled website.

# Optional production path override, normally supplied by GitHub Actions.
# Root site or custom domain: /
# Repository site: /your-repository/
# PAGES_BASE_PATH=/

# Only needed after implementing the optional Supabase repository adapter:
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
